{"suttaId":"an4.119","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iv","vriCode":"s0402m3.mul","paras":[1082,1082],"vripara":"119"},"segments":{"an4.119:0.3":"Paṭhamabhayasuttaṃ","an4.119:1.1":"“Cattārimāni, bhikkhave, bhayāni.","an4.119:1.2":"Katamāni cattāri?","an4.119:1.3":"Jātibhayaṃ, jarābhayaṃ, byādhibhayaṃ, maraṇabhayaṃ – imāni kho, bhikkhave, cattāri bhayānī”ti.","an4.119:1.5":"Navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Mp-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0402a.att","from":1401,"to":1404,"paras":[{"para":1401,"vripara":"118-120","refs":["an4.119:1"],"lines":["118-120. Aṭṭhame <b>dassanīyānī</b>ti passitabbayuttakāni.","<b>Saṃvejanīyānī</b>ti saṃvegajanakāni.","Navame <b>jātibhayan</b>ti jātiṃ ārabbha uppajjanakabhayaṃ.","Sesapadesupi eseva nayo.","Dasame <b>aggibhayan</b>ti aggiṃ paṭicca uppajjanakabhayaṃ.","Sesapadesupi eseva nayo."],"lineRefs":[["an4.119:1"],["an4.119:1"],["an4.119:1"],["an4.119:1"],["an4.119:1"],["an4.119:1"]]},{"para":1402,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.119:1"],"lines":["Kesivaggo dutiyo."],"lineRefs":[["an4.119:1"]]},{"para":1403,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.119:1"],"lines":["(13)3. Bhayavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["an4.119:1"]]},{"para":1404,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.119:1"],"lines":["Attānuvādasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an4.119:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0402t.tik","from":1581,"to":1585,"paras":[{"para":1581,"vripara":"118-120","refs":["an4.119:1"],"lines":["118-120. Aṭṭhame <b>saddhassā</b>ti buddhādīsu pasannacittassa vattasampannassa, yassa pāto vuṭṭhāya cetiyaṅgaṇavattādīni sabbavattāni katāneva paññāyanti.","<b>Dassanīyānī</b>ti dassanārahāni.","<b>Saṃvego</b> nāma sahottappaṃ ñāṇaṃ.","Abhijātiṭṭhānādīnipi tassa uppattihetūni bhavantīti sikkhāpento āha <b>“saṃvegajanakānī”</b>ti.","<b>Ṭhānānī</b>ti kāraṇāni, padesaṭṭhānāni vā.","Navamadasamāni suviññeyyāni."],"lineRefs":[["an4.119:1"],["an4.119:1"],["an4.119:1"],["an4.119:1"],["an4.119:1"],["an4.119:1"]]},{"para":1582,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.119:1"],"lines":["Saṃvejanīyasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an4.119:1"]]},{"para":1583,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.119:1"],"lines":["Kesivaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an4.119:1"]]},{"para":1584,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.119:1"],"lines":["(13)3. Bhayavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["an4.119:1"]]},{"para":1585,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.119:1"],"lines":["Attānuvādasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an4.119:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
